The '''Salve amulet (i)''' is the imbued form of the [[salve amulet]], granting an additional 16.67%{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1171387277655846913|date=10 September 2019|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/97380|archivedate=26 April 2020|quote=It's 1/6, so 16% is closer.}} increase in the wearer's [[ranged]] accuracy and damage, as well as a 15% increase for [[magic]], when fighting [[Undead (attribute)|undead monsters]].

The salve amulet is imbued by using either 800,000 [[Nightmare Zone]] [[Nightmare Zone#Rewards|points]] (halved upon completing the [[Combat Achievements/Hard|hard combat achievements]]), 320 [[Soul Wars]] [[Zeal Tokens]], or by using a [[scroll of imbuing]] on the amulet. Amulets imbued through the latter two methods do '''not''' count for completing the [[Ardougne Diary]] task.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1355871771208134657|date=31 January 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/107617|archivedate=5 February 2021|quote=No, the Soul Wars version is a different item from the NMZ item, and it doesn't do a task check.}} Furthermore, amulets imbued at one location cannot be refunded at a different location.

