==Effects and upgrades==
:''For a list of monsters affected by the salve amulet, [[Undead (attribute)|see here]].''
The salve amulet's bonuses against the undead '''do not''' stack with the [[black mask]] and [[Slayer helmet|slayer helmet's]] on-task bonuses; wearing both will only apply the bonuses of the salve amulet (i). However, the bonuses of [[Void Knight equipment]] '''does''' stack. Additionally, the amulet's effects apply to all targets when using multi-hitting melee weapons in a [[multicombat area]], such as the [[Scythe of Vitur]] and the [[special attack]] of the [[dragon 2h sword]], but not for multi-hitting magic and ranged attacks (ex. [[Chinchompa (weapon)|chinchompas]] and [[burst spells]]).

The salve amulet (i) can also be enchanted, increasing all of the amulet's undead bonuses to 20%. This requires using [[Tarn's diary]], acquired as part of the [[Lair of Tarn Razorlor]] miniquest.

